## The foundation as a sinking fund
- **Annual foundation bill ≈ RM19,394/yr** (RM1,616.20/mo × 12). This is what it costs to keep the whole stack stocked for a year.
- You **buy in lumps** (PED vials, peptide orders, India ancillary bulk), so real cash is spiky. Setting aside **RM1,616/mo** smooths it: the fund is always topped up to cover the next bulk buy.
- **"When is my salary free?"** Once a year's foundation is front-loaded, monthly foundation cash drops to perishables only — the set-aside then accumulates as investable until the next annual restock. The **RM1,376/mo above is your free-to-invest figure today.**

